      "rkaf:applicabilityCondition": "Except as provided in paragraph (b) of 49 CFR 1540.111, when performance has begun of the inspection of an individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter; when the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or when the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter."
    },
