      "rkaf:assertsValue": {
        "@value": "All of the following conditions must be satisfied: (i) passenger declares to aircraft operator orally or in writing before checking baggage that passenger has an unloaded firearm in the bag; (ii) firearm is unloaded; (iii) firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and (iv) container is locked with only the passenger retaining key or combination.",
